---
/**
 * Persistent spam advisory banner — SBGC-219.
 *
 * Full-width amber alert mounted directly above the site footer (via
 * BaseLayout's `showSpamWarning` prop) on the account-recovery pages.  It
 * reminds users to check spam/junk before hammering the recovery endpoints —
 * the backend enforces a 30-minute lockout after repeated requests.
 */
---

<div
  class="w-full border-y border-amber-500/30 bg-amber-500/10 px-4 py-3 text-center"
  role="alert"
>
  <p class="text-sm font-medium text-amber-300">
    <span class="mr-1.5 font-bold">Please Note:</span>
    Check your spam or junk folder before requesting a reset multiple times. Repeated
    requests will temporarily lock access for 30 minutes.
  </p>
</div>
